          "author": "Koala Kids",
          "description": "This cozy bedtime story collection follows Koko Koala as he helps his Sleepy Forest Friends with their most magical wishes. These original never-before-heard stories are from the creators of the award-winning podcast Koala Moon, written in collaboration with Luke Prendergast. ﻿This sleepy collection celebrates kindness & bravery whilst helping your little ones relax into sleep night after night. ﻿\n\nThis card includes:﻿\n﻿﻿1. Koko & The Wishing Well \n2. Prickle's Tickly Slippers \n3. Hector & Sunny's Lazy River Raft \n4. Camo's Bravery Cookie \n5. Koko's Hot Chocolate Bubble Bath",
